{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Welcome to the open sea!</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sloop is a handcrafted adventure with hand drawn animations and an rolling oceanic soundtrack  where you'll overcome a challenging set of obstacles in your way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find your way to the exit!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948910/extras/a1cad0203fabc8c3348a2aee4682cfaf.poster.avif?t=1755408377\" width=780 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948910/extras/a1cad0203fabc8c3348a2aee4682cfaf.webm?t=1755408377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948910/extras/a1cad0203fabc8c3348a2aee4682cfaf.mp4?t=1755408377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level will have an exit to find and reach to win. <i><strong>Some won't be so easy!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn to navigate!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948910/extras/2a52b8ac9252590560bc5ba3aadf95c1.poster.avif?t=1755408377\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948910/extras/2a52b8ac9252590560bc5ba3aadf95c1.webm?t=1755408377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948910/extras/2a52b8ac9252590560bc5ba3aadf95c1.mp4?t=1755408377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to steer your tricky vessel on the water. <i><strong>Master the rudder!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take your best shot!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948910/extras/02c46bde5567b5244bfbfc071e12ca2e.poster.avif?t=1755408377\" width=780 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948910/extras/02c46bde5567b5244bfbfc071e12ca2e.webm?t=1755408377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948910/extras/02c46bde5567b5244bfbfc071e12ca2e.mp4?t=1755408377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit targets to open locked exits with looping boomerangs. <i><strong>Watch your backside!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brave the sharp turns!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948910/extras/7393649416d689e88a31cded6d5e9b14.poster.avif?t=1755408377\" width=780 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948910/extras/7393649416d689e88a31cded6d5e9b14.webm?t=1755408377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948910/extras/7393649416d689e88a31cded6d5e9b14.mp4?t=1755408377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of lasso hooks to take turns too sharp for your ship to steer on its own. <i><strong>LASSO AT THE READY!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And more ...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948910/extras/06c7d4f4103dc755ee286526b313cc05.poster.avif?t=1755408377\" width=780 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948910/extras/06c7d4f4103dc755ee286526b313cc05.webm?t=1755408377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948910/extras/06c7d4f4103dc755ee286526b313cc05.mp4?t=1755408377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the deadly seas yourself to witness all the perils that await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>... catch you on the water!</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948910?t=1755408377","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948910?t=1755408377","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948910/eb07b4e7b97b82cf13bdfac2879480b05cc99813/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755408377","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948910/eb07b4e7b97b82cf13bdfac2879480b05cc99813/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755408377","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Welcome to the open sea!</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sloop is a handcrafted adventure with hand drawn animations and an rolling oceanic soundtrack  where you'll overcome a challenging set of obstacles in your way.\u